            "review_title": "Review at Chilli Thai - Vincom Center Dong Khoi",
            "review_text": "Excursion12561742532\n3 contributions\n0\nGreat Food!!!!\nJul 2025 • Friends\nChecked out Chilli Thai at Vincom Dong Khoi – had the chilli sea bass, garlic chayote shoots, and glass noodle salad. All super tasty, fresh, fair price, quick service. Modern design with a touch of traditional Thai style – cozy yet elegant vibe. Clean, spacious, and well-ventilated. Perfect spot for a meal with friends or family, highly recommend!\nWritten October 5, 2025",
