            "review_title": "Review at Chilli Thai - Vincom Center Dong Khoi",
            "review_text": "Phát N\n1 contribution\n0\nA Glowing Review of Chilli Thai - A Culinary Gem in District 1\nMay 2025 • Family\nIf you're searching for an authentic and exceptional Thai dining experience right in the heart of District 1, look no further than Chilli Thai! This restaurant is truly a culinary highlight, deserving of every praise it receives. Exquisite Ambiance: Stylish and Inviting. The Food: Authentic Flavors and Culinary Excellence. Impeccable Service and Great Value. In summary, Chilli Thai is a radiant gem in Saigon’s dining scene. It’s the ultimate destination for anyone seeking authentic, delicious Thai food in a beautiful setting with top-notch service. You will leave feeling completely satisfied!\nRead more\nWritten October 5, 2025",
