            "review_text": "Diệu H\n7 contributions\n0\nThe best Thai restaurant\nJun 2025 • Family\nI recently dined at Chilli Thai in District 1, HCMC (at Vincom Đong Khoi ), and here is my honest assessment : Chilli Thai is an appealing choice if you’re craving Thai food in HCMC, especially for its ambiance, menu variety, and occasional standout dishes. But be prepared for some inconsistency in service and flavor. A sample bill for several dishes might land around VND 400,000 for two to three people. If you’re visiting, going during off‑peak hours and checking the bill carefully might help you enjoy a more pleasant experience.\nRead more\nWritten October 4, 2025",
